    <li><span class="what">JavaScript</span>{% stars 3 %}<span class="note">Implemented tail calls and wrote run‑time support primitives for the Racket‑to‑JavaScript compiler used in <a href="https://www.wescheme.org/">WeScheme</a> for the <a href="https://www.bootstrapworld.org/">Bootstrap curriculum</a>.</span></li>
    <li><span class="what">Misc.</span>{% stars 1 %}<span class="note">At various times I’ve written SQL for DBs; Matlab and R for statistical analysis; CSS, YAML, JSON and XML for configs; and more.</span></li>
